### Requests for the VS Code REST Client extension. Start the API first:
### go run ./cmd/api
### With DEMO_AUTH_TEST_CLAIMS=false, add: Authorization: Bearer <token>

@host = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Create a task
# @name created
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write the README",
  "notes": "Explain how to add a service"
}

### List tasks
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks?limit=10

### List finished tasks
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks?done=true

### Get the created task
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/{{created.response.body.data.id}}

### Mark it done
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/{{created.response.body.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": true
}

### Delete it
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/{{created.response.body.data.id}}

### Validation error (422)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}
